features and upstream services, and uses its own branding and data storage.

Loci is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the makers of the
agent harnesses it can drive. Claude and Codex marks are trademarks of their
respective owners and are used only to identify those products.

Loci ships the official Excalidraw MCP server unmodified in
src-tauri/resources/excalidraw-mcp/official (MIT; origin, version and file
hashes are recorded in the SOURCE file beside it). Excalidraw is a trademark
of its owners and is used only to identify that project.
